flowchart LR
  A[Trusted project source] --> B[Build wheel + sdist]
  B --> C[Static artifact inspection]
  C --> D[Rebuild wheel from sdist]
  D --> E[Install wheel in fresh virtual environment]
  E --> F[Isolated imports + console-script help]
  F --> G[Findings + JSON report + exit code]
  G --> H{Error findings?}
  H -- No --> I[PASS · exit 0]
  H -- Yes --> J[FAIL · non-zero exit]
